# Reactive Surface Document Index

> Scope semantics: `hash lock`, `hash-locked`, and `non-mutation control` in any report or evidence file mean a round-local regression comparison only. They are historical proof that an out-of-scope asset did not change in that run, never a permanent edit prohibition. The newest explicit user request defines the current editable scope.
>
> Current state: there is no permanent channel edit ban on Ground, Snow, Water, or Grass.

이 인덱스가 Reactive Surface 시스템 문서 묶음의 진입점이다. 모든 durable 문서와 재현 러너는 이 `UnrealMCP5_6_1` 체크아웃 하위에 둔다. 외부 `CubelessOps`나 다른 sibling repo는 canonical 위치가 아니다.

## Primary Plan

- `reactive-surface-implementation-plan-2026-07-05.md` - Implementation work plan in Claude token-saving review format. Section 0 is the default review surface.
- `reactive-surface-plan-delta-2026-07-05.md` - Validation-plan additive delta table. Claude can read this instead of the full validation-plan.

- `reactive-surface-final-implementation-lock-2026-07-05.md` - Latest implementation lock. Excludes the 2026-07-05 three-RT / 50-slot always-active future smoke from the first Reactive Surface plan.

- `reactive-surface-system-validation-plan.md` - 확정 구현 검증 계획과 최신 Go/No-Go 기준.
- `interaction-field-system.md` - 실측 근거 대조용 InteractionField 문서.

